<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Priyal Shah — B.Sc. Computer Science student and aspiring full-stack web developer.">
  <title>Priyal Shah | Developer Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <script defer src="/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ambient ambient-one"></div><div class="ambient ambient-two"></div>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="nav container">
      <a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-mark">P</span> priyal<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
      <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a href="#about">About</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a>
        <a class="nav-contact" href="#contact">Let's talk <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero container" id="home">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> OPEN TO LEARNING & OPPORTUNITIES</div>
        <h1>Building ideas<br>into <span class="gradient-text">digital reality.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Hi, I'm <strong>Priyal Shah</strong> — a Computer Science student and aspiring full-stack developer who enjoys creating useful, clean and responsive web experiences.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#projects">Explore my work <span>↗</span></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="#contact">Get in touch</a></div>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span>⌘ Web development</span><span>⌖ Maharashtra, India</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="code-window">
          <div class="window-top"><div class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span>priyal.js</span><span>•••</span></div>
          <div class="code-body">
            <div><span class="line-number">01</span><span class="code-purple">const</span> developer = {</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">02</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;name: <span class="code-green">'Priyal Shah'</span>,</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">03</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;role: <span class="code-green">'Full Stack Dev'</span>,</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">04</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;curious: <span class="code-orange">true</span>,</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">05</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;skills: [</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">06</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-green">'JavaScript'</span>,</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">07</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-green">'Node.js'</span>,</div>
            <div><span class="line-number">08</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-green">'MongoDB'</span></div>
            <div><span class="line-number">09</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;]</div><div><span class="line-number">10</span>};<span class="cursor">▍</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="float-card float-card-top"><span class="float-icon">✳</span><div><strong>Curious mind</strong><small>Always learning</small></div></div>
        <div class="float-card float-card-bottom"><span class="float-icon">{ }</span><div><strong>Build. Learn. Repeat.</strong><small>One project at a time</small></div></div>
        <div class="hero-glow"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="stats-strip container">
      <div><strong>03<span>+</span></strong><small>Featured projects</small></div>
      <div><strong>Full-stack</strong><small>Learning & building</small></div>
      <div><strong>2024–27</strong><small>B.Sc. Computer Science</small></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section container" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">01 / ABOUT ME</span><h2>A little about <span class="gradient-text">my journey.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-main panel"><div class="about-symbol">PS<span>.</span></div><h3>Turning curiosity into code.</h3>
          <p>I'm pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Computer Science at Sangamner College, Sangamner. I enjoy learning how web applications work, from user interfaces to server-side logic and databases.</p>
          <p>My goal is to keep improving through hands-on projects, collaboration and continuous learning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="education-card panel"><span class="section-kicker">EDUCATION</span><div class="education-icon">⌘</div><h3>B.Sc. Computer Science</h3><p>Sangamner College, Sangamner</p><div class="education-footer"><span>2024 – 2027</span><span class="pill">Undergraduate</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section container" id="skills">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">02 / TOOLKIT</span><h2>Skills I'm <span class="gradient-text">working with.</span></h2><p>Technologies I use while learning and building projects.</p></div>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <article class="skill-card panel"><span class="skill-icon">◈</span><h3>Frontend</h3><div class="tag-list"><span>HTML5</span><span>CSS3</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>Bootstrap</span><span>React.js</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card panel"><span class="skill-icon">⌘</span><h3>Backend</h3><div class="tag-list"><span>Node.js</span><span>Express.js</span><span>EJS</span><span>REST APIs</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card panel"><span class="skill-icon">▤</span><h3>Database</h3><div class="tag-list"><span>MongoDB</span><span>MySQL</span><span>SQL</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card panel"><span class="skill-icon">⌨</span><h3>Programming & Tools</h3><div class="tag-list"><span>Java</span><span>C</span><span>Git</span><span>GitHub</span></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section container" id="projects">
      <div class="section-heading section-heading-row"><div><span class="section-kicker">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><h2>Projects with <span class="gradient-text">purpose.</span></h2></div><span class="project-count">03 PROJECTS</span></div>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        <% projects.forEach((project, index) => { %>
          <article class="project-card panel">
            <div class="project-art art-<%= index + 1 %>"><span class="project-art-icon"><%= project.icon %></span><span class="project-number">0<%= index + 1 %></span><div class="art-orbit"></div></div>
            <div class="project-content"><span class="project-category"><%= project.category %></span><h3><%= project.title %></h3><p><%= project.description %></p>
              <div class="tag-list project-tags"><% project.tech.forEach(tech => { %><span><%= tech %></span><% }) %></div>
              <a class="project-link" href="<%= project.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View project <span>↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">Tip: replace the placeholder GitHub links in <code>server.js</code> with your actual project repository URLs.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section container" id="experience">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">04 / EXPERIENCE</span><h2>Learning by <span class="gradient-text">doing.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="timeline panel">
        <div class="timeline-marker"></div><div class="timeline-content"><div class="timeline-top"><span class="pill">Internship</span><span class="timeline-date">Practical experience</span></div>
          <h3>Web Development Intern</h3><h4>Thiranex Edu Tech LLP</h4>
          <p>Worked on a REST API task and responsive website development, gaining practical exposure to building web interfaces and connecting frontend experiences with backend services.</p>
          <div class="tag-list"><span>REST APIs</span><span>Responsive Design</span><span>Web Development</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card panel"><div class="cert-icon">✓</div><div><span class="section-kicker">CERTIFICATION</span><h3>Full Stack Web Development</h3><p>Udemy course</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="container contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-copy"><span class="section-kicker">05 / CONTACT</span><h2>Have an idea?<br><span class="gradient-text">Let's connect.</span></h2><p>Have an internship opportunity, project idea or just want to say hello? Send me a message.</p>
        <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:priyal@example.com">priyal@example.com <span>↗</span></a><small class="hint">Update this placeholder email in views/index.ejs with your real email address.</small>
      </div>
      <form class="contact-form panel" action="/contact" method="POST">
        <h3>Send a message</h3>
        <% if (success) { %><div class="form-alert success">Thanks! Your message was saved successfully.</div><% } %>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="form-alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
        <label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Enter your name" maxlength="80" required>
        <label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" maxlength="160" required>
        <label for="subject">Subject <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="subject" name="subject" type="text" placeholder="What is this about?" maxlength="120">
        <label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell me a little about it..." maxlength="3000" required></textarea>
        <button class="button button-primary submit-button" type="submit">Send message <span>↗</span></button>
        <p class="form-note">Messages are stored in MongoDB. Configure your database before using this form.</p>
      </form>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-inner"><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-mark">P</span> priyal<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><p>Designed & built with care by Priyal Shah.</p><a href="#home" class="back-top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
